{
  "title": "2nd Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ قَرِّبْنِیْ فِیْهِ اِلٰی مَرْضَاتِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA QARRIBNEE FEEHE ELAA MARZAATEKA \nO Allah! On this day, take me closer towards Your pleasure, \nوَجَنِّبْنِیْ فِیْهِ مِنْ سَخَطِكَ وَنَقِمَاتِكَ\nWA JANNIBNEE FEEHE MIN SAKAHTEKA WA NAQEMAATEKA \nkeep me away from Your anger and punishment, \nوَوَفِّقْنِیْ فِیْهِ لِقَرَآئَۃِ اٰیَاتِكَ\nWA WAFFIQNEE FEEHE LE-QERAA-ATE AAYAATEKA \ngrant me the opportunity to recite Your verses (of the Qur’an), \nبِرَحْمَتِكَ یَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ.\nBE-RAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nby Your mercy, O the most Merciful."
}
